{# BJJ Submission Defender Page Template #}
{# Generates defender perspective pages from defender section #}
{# Input: defender (full defender section), name (hub name), from_position, outcomes, safety_considerations, target_area #}

---
title: "{{ defender.name }} | BJJ Defense Guide | BJJ Graph"
description: "{{ defender.description }}"
---

{# PostHog A/B Testing Metadata #}
<body data-content-type="submissions">

> **SAFETY**: {{ name }} targets the {{ target_area }}. Tap early and often. Your safety is more important than any training round.

<!-- Schema Markup - HowTo for Defense -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Defend {{ name }} in BJJ",
  "description": "Step-by-step guide for defending and escaping {{ name }} in BJJ.",
  "step": [
    {%- for option in defender.defensive_options[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "name": "{{ option.action }}",
      "text": "{{ option.when_to_use }}{% if option.if_successful %} If successful: {{ option.if_successful }}{% endif %}",
      "position": {{ loop.index }}
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ],
  "tool": ["BJJ Gi or No-Gi attire", "Training partner", "Mat space"],
  "totalTime": "PT5M"
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - FAQ from Knowledge Assessment -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {%- for qa in defender.knowledge_assessment[:6] %}
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "{{ qa.question }}",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "{{ qa.answer }}"
      }
    }{{ "," if not loop.last else "" }}
    {%- endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - WebPage -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "{{ defender.name }}",
  "description": "{{ defender.description }}",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "BJJ Graph",
    "url": "https://bjjgraph.org"
  }
}
</script>

<!-- Schema Markup - Breadcrumbs -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Home",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Submissions",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "{{ name }}",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/{{ name.replace(' ', '-') }}"
    },
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": 4,
      "name": "Defender",
      "item": "https://bjjgraph.org/Submissions/{{ name.replace(' ', '-') }}/Defender"
    }
  ]
}
</script>

{# Flexbox wrapper for A/B testing #}
<main class="content-wrapper" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

<section id="overview" class="content-section">

{{ defender.overview }}

{% if from_position is defined and from_position -%}
**Opponent's Starting Position**: [[{{ from_position.split('/')[0] }}]] ({{ from_position.split('/')[1] if '/' in from_position else '' }})
{% endif %}

</section>

<section id="recognition-cues" class="content-section">

## How to Recognize This Submission

{% for cue in defender.recognition_cues -%}
- {{ cue }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="key-principles" class="content-section">

## Key Defensive Principles

{% for principle in defender.key_principles -%}
- {{ principle }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="defensive-options" class="content-section">

## Defensive Options

{% for option in defender.defensive_options -%}
### {{ loop.index }}. {{ option.action }}

- **When to use**: {{ option.when_to_use }}
- **Targets**: [[{{ option.targets_outcome.split('/')[0] if '/' in option.targets_outcome else option.targets_outcome }}]]
{% if option.if_successful %}- **If successful**: {{ option.if_successful }}{% endif %}
{% if option.risk %}- **Risk**: {{ option.risk }}{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="escape-paths" class="content-section">

## Escape Paths

{% for escape in defender.escape_paths -%}
- {{ escape }}
{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="favorable-outcomes" class="content-section">

## Best-Case Outcomes for Defender

{% for favorable in defender.favorable_outcomes -%}
### → [[{{ favorable.outcome.split('/')[0] if '/' in favorable.outcome else favorable.outcome }}]]

{{ favorable.how }}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="common-mistakes" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Common Defensive Mistakes

{% for error in defender.common_errors -%}
### {{ loop.index }}. {{ error.error }}

- **Consequence**: {{ error.consequence }}
- **Correction**: {{ error.correction }}

{% endfor %}

</section>

<section id="training-progressions" class="content-section hide-minimal">

## Training Progressions

{% for progression in defender.training_progressions -%}
**{{ progression.phase }}** - {{ progression.focus }}
{{ progression.description }}

{% endfor %}

</section>

{% if defender.knowledge_assessment %}
<section id="knowledge-assessment" class="content-section">

## Test Your Knowledge

{% for qa in defender.knowledge_assessment -%}
**Q{{ loop.index }}**: {{ qa.question }}{% if qa.safety_critical %} **[SAFETY-CRITICAL]**{% endif %}
**A**: {{ qa.answer }}

{% endfor %}

</section>
{% endif %}

</main>
